WEBVTT

00:08:59.868 --> 00:09:01.787
before I get a direct answer.

00:09:02.454 --> 00:09:04.039
And there's a deeper issue.

00:09:04.832 --> 00:09:06.000
The more you're treated

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:08.419
as if you don't know
what you're talking about,

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:12.131
the more you begin to question
whether or not you do, in fact,

00:09:12.172 --> 00:09:13.757
know what you're talking about.

00:09:14.383 --> 00:09:15.551
Right?

00:09:15.551 --> 00:09:19.555
(Applause)

00:09:19.597 --> 00:09:23.225
I understand a woman's tendency
to doubt herself.

00:09:24.184 --> 00:09:27.271
Do you ever notice if a woman
is in a meeting with a group of men

00:09:27.271 --> 00:09:30.232
and she knows she's right,
she apologizes for it?